dsh-session-ssh

This independent plugin is based on the SSH plugin source originally developed
in zhu1090093659/dsh-web/packages/dsh-ssh and retains its Apache-2.0 provenance.
It is not the @linxin666/dsh-ssh project and does not silently replace it.

The input-bar multi-select interaction is independently implemented with
reference to E:\\github\\dsh-mysql. The reference repository is not a build
dependency. If substantial MIT-licensed source is copied in a future change,
its copyright and license notice must be retained here and in the distribution.

